#   its gap, an SBC arm with its result, an analytic identity, or a
#   cross-implementation check. "The deviation looks like the expected
#   class" is an adjudication, not an oracle; a row relying on it must say
#   so explicitly. The retrospective classification of links recorded
#   before this rule lives in the 2026-08-17 baseline-provenance audit
#   (.claude/rc-review-p10-baseline-provenance-2026-08-17.md), not here.
